abstract: >-
  Open-source pancreatic oncology discovery software with a cited
  research-intelligence core and explainable workflow surfaces such as
  radiology report triage, retrospective benchmarking, and case briefs.
  Research-use workflow software; not for autonomous diagnosis, treatment
  recommendation, or unsupervised clinical deployment.
